You draw kinetic energy from your surroundings to replenish your Psi.

This will slow all targets within radius [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] by [15%, 16%, 17%, 18%, 19% (TL1-5; PSI 50%)] (max [16%, 17%, 18%, 19%, 20% (TL1-5)]) for four turns, draining [26, 35, 41, 47, 52 (TL1-5; MP 100; PSI 50%)] (max [38, 52, 62, 71, 79 (TL1-5; MP 100)]) stamina from each.

You replenish [10, 13, 15, 18, 20 (TL1-5; PSI 50%)] (max [15, 20, 23, 27, 30 (TL1-5)]) Psi from the first target, with each additional target restoring 20% less than the one before it.

The strength of these effects increases as your Psi depletes and with your Mindpower.
